        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Reap Memory"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, mental)\n\nThe joseung saja looks into the eyes of a creature within 30 feet and removes inconvenient or painful memories that are preventing it from moving on to death. The target is aware that the joseung saja attempted to alter its memory and can attempt a Will save to resist. Willing targets receive the effects of a critical failure.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target takes 2d10 mental damage and is stupefied 2 for 1 round.\nFailure: The target takes 4d10 mental damage and is stupefied 2 for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: The target loses all painful emotions and memories, leaving an indistinct haze. If the target is an ijhyeojin, then all of their memories are reaped and they become a joseung saja."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "7e59e9ec-c892-4af4-8efd-d7604a87aa66",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:35.671692"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Shifting Form"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nThe joseung saja is incorporeal until the end of their next turn. While they're incorporeal, they have resistance 10 to all damage (except force, void, and ghost touch weapons)."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
